  data: {
    LLM: "Focus on clearing your initial 11 cards quickly to grab the 'pot' before the opponents. Don't worry about clean biribas until you have your second hand.\n\nDiscard Pile Management: If the pile contains cards that help your runs, wait for it to grow large before capturing it. Conversely, discard 'poison' cards that don't help opponents.\n\nDefensive Melding: Don't lay down your melds too early if they reveal your strategy to the opponents. Keep components in hand until you can complete a 7-card biriba in one move.",
